<title>USA: U.S. DLA sold 20 tonnes stockpile tin.</title>
<headline>U.S. DLA sold 20 tonnes stockpile tin.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense Logistics Agency said it sold 20 tonnes of stockpile tin at its daily offering Monday to F &amp; S Alloys of New York, N.Y. at a unit price of $2.81 per lb.</p>
<p>The DLA said the total approximate value of the sale was $124,000.</p>
